<title>SINGAPORE: South Korea's KEPCO buys May LSWR at $18.55/bbl.</title>
<headline>South Korea's KEPCO buys May LSWR at $18.55/bbl.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korean Electric Power Corp (KEPCO) has awarded its tender to buy 500,000 barrels of May low sulphur waxy residue to Dutch trader Vitol, a company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The cargo for delivery between May 11-15 to the ports of Ulsan or Pusan is awarded at $18.55 per barrel on a cost-and-freight basis, the official said.</p>
<p>KEPCO last purchased a 500,000 cargo of LSWR for April 21-25 delivery from South Korea's Yukong Ltd  4410.KS at $19.93 per a barrel on a delivered and duty paid basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
